{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","惧怖厉锋"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","恐慌の刃"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","被动地，累计数次普通攻击可使敌人进入“战怖”状态。主动释放时，处决“战怖”状态的敌人，对其造成伤害并回复自身生命值。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","パッシブ効果：一定回数の通常攻撃で、敵を「パニック」状態にすることが可能。アクティブ効果：「パニック」状態の敵にダメージを与え、自身のHPを回復"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，瓦丽卡的普通攻击会对目标施加一层“战怖”，持续10秒。累计4层“战怖”后，敌人将进入持续10秒的“战怖”状态，期间降低10点急速。\n瓦丽卡的终极技能仅能对1格范围内“战怖”状态的敌人释放，消耗100点能量和该名敌人的“战怖”状态，使其眩晕并进行处决，造成两次目标最大生命值6% + 1.5%的真实伤害，回复自身350% + 50% ATK生命值。随后拔出大剑，造成目标最大生命值12% + 2%的真实伤害并将其击倒（每次伤害值均不超过400% ATK）。技能期间自身处于霸体状态，每6 − 0.4秒对同一名敌人至多使用一次。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","パッシブ効果：通常攻撃は対象に10秒間の「パニック」を1スタック付与。「パニック」が4スタックに達した敵は「パニック」状態になり、10秒間、速度-10\nヴェリカの必殺技の発動対象は、1マス範囲内の「パニック」状態の敵のみ。必殺技を発動すると、100のSPと対象の「パニック」状態を消費し、対象にスタンを付与し、処刑する。処刑は対象にそのHP上限×6% + 1.5%の確定ダメージを2回与え、自身のHPを350% + 50% ATK分回復した後、さらに大剣を抜いて、そのHP上限×12% + 2%の確定ダメージを与え、ノックダウンさせる。どのダメージも400% ATKを超えない。スキル発動中、自身はスーパーアーマー状態になる。必殺技は敵1体につき、6 − 0.4秒ごとに1回まで発動可能"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":142,"end":149,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":163,"end":169,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"},{"start":196,"end":201,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"},{"start":246,"end":252,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg5"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":175,"end":182,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":205,"end":211,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg4"},{"start":242,"end":247,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"},{"start":325,"end":331,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg5"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":159,"end":173,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":221,"end":229,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":239,"end":241,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":201,"end":215,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":275,"end":283,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":299,"end":307,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","主动使用时，对目标的前两次伤害提升至7.5% + 1.5%最大生命值，最后一击伤害提升至13.5% + 2%最大生命值（伤害值均不超过500% ATK）。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","アクティブ効果：対象に与える1回目と2回目のダメージがそのHP上限×7.5% + 1.5%にUPし、最後の一撃のダメージがそのHP上限×13.5% + 2%にUP。どのダメージも500% ATKを超えない"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":29,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":49,"end":54,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":38,"end":45,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":73,"end":78,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":67,"end":75,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":89,"end":97,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","主动使用时，对目标的前两次伤害提升至9% + 1.5%最大生命值，最后一击伤害提升至15% + 2%最大生命值（伤害值均不超过600% ATK）。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","アクティブ効果：対象に与える1回目と2回目のダメージがそのHP上限×9% + 1.5%にUPし、最後の一撃のダメージがそのHP上限×15% + 2%にUP。どのダメージも600% ATKを超えない"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":27,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":45,"end":50,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":36,"end":43,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":69,"end":74,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":63,"end":71,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":85,"end":93,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","主动使用时，对目标的前两次伤害提升至10.5% + 1.5%最大生命值，最后一击伤害提升至16.5% + 2%最大生命值（伤害值均不超过700% ATK）。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","アクティブ効果：対象に与える1回目と2回目のダメージがそのHP上限×10.5% + 1.5%にUPし、最後の一撃のダメージがそのHP上限×16.5% + 2%にUP。どのダメージも700% ATKを超えない"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":30,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":50,"end":55,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":39,"end":46,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":74,"end":79,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":68,"end":76,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":90,"end":98,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","主动使用时，对目标的前两次伤害提升至12% + 1.5%最大生命值，最后一击伤害提升至18% + 2%最大生命值（伤害值均不超过800% ATK）。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/jp","アクティブ効果：対象に与える1回目と2回目のダメージがそのHP上限×12% + 1.5%にUPし、最後の一撃のダメージがそのHP上限×18% + 2%にUP。どのダメージも800% ATKを超えない"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":28,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":46,"end":51,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":37,"end":44,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":70,"end":75,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":64,"end":72,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":86,"end":94,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","葬送诡策"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/jp","葬送の策"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","瓦丽卡灵活地使用各种剑技进行战斗。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/jp","様々な剣技を駆使して戦う"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","瓦丽卡积累战斗经验，随着等级提升习得各种剑技，并在合适的情景使用。各种剑技均视为普通攻击，且具有独立的冷却时间。\n瓦丽卡习得新剑技“斩魂利剑”：当自身1格范围内有大于1名敌人时，消耗300点能量，对1格范围内敌人进行2次斩击，每次斩击造成140% + 15% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","戦闘経験を積み、レベルアップと共に様々な剣技を習得し、状況に応じて剣技を使う。剣技はすべて、通常攻撃と見なされ、別々にCDを計算する\n新たな剣技「斬魂の剣」を習得：自身の周囲1マス範囲内の敵が1体より多い場合、SPを300消費し、周囲1マス範囲内の敵に斬撃を2回繰り出し、1回の斬撃につき140% + 15% ATKのダメージを与える"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":123,"end":129,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":148,"end":154,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":119,"end":133,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":144,"end":158,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","瓦丽卡习得新剑技“暴骸重刃”：当自身1格范围内仅有1名敌人时，消耗300点能量，对一名敌人进行劈砍，造成140% + 20% ATK伤害，随后跳起进行威力更大的下劈，造成190% + 25% ATK伤害并击倒敌人1秒。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","新たな剣技「解体の刃」を習得：自身の周囲1マス範囲内の敵が1体のみの場合、SPを300消費し、敵1体に上段斬りを繰り出し、140% + 20% ATKのダメージを与え、その後に強力なジャンプ斬りを繰り出し、190% + 25% ATKのダメージを与え、対象を1秒間ノックダウンさせる"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":56,"end":62,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"},{"start":89,"end":95,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg5"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":65,"end":71,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"},{"start":107,"end":113,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg5"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":52,"end":66,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":85,"end":99,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":61,"end":75,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":103,"end":117,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","瓦丽卡习得新剑技“纵横追击”：当自身1格范围内无敌人时，消耗150点能量，朝3格内最近的敌人翻滚，躲避高度较高的普通攻击弹道，自身获得可抵御220% ATK伤害的护盾，翻滚结束后顺势下劈，造成150% + 15% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","新たな剣技「四方追撃」を習得：自身の周囲1マス範囲内に敵がいない場合、SPを150消費し、3マス内の最も近い敵に向かってローリングし、弾道が一定の高さ以上の通常攻撃を回避し、220% ATKのダメージを防ぐシールドを獲得。ローリング終了後、上段斬りで敵に150% + 15% ATKのダメージを与える"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":100,"end":106,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg7"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":131,"end":137,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg7"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":70,"end":78,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":96,"end":110,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":87,"end":95,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":127,"end":141,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“斩魂利剑”每一击的伤害提升至180% + 15% ATK。\n“暴骸重刃”第一击的伤害提升至170% + 20% ATK，第二击伤害提升至230% + 25% ATK。\n“纵横追击”对敌人的伤害提升至180% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","「斬魂の剣」1斬撃ごとのダメージが180% + 15% ATKにUP\n「解体の刃」の上段斬りのダメージが170% + 20% ATKにUPし、ジャンプ斬りのダメージが230% + 25% ATKにUP\n「四方追撃」のダメージが180% + 15% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":25,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":50,"end":56,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"},{"start":73,"end":79,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg5"},{"start":104,"end":110,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg7"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":21,"end":27,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":56,"end":62,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"},{"start":87,"end":93,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg5"},{"start":117,"end":123,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg7"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":29,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":46,"end":60,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":69,"end":83,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":100,"end":114,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":17,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":52,"end":66,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":83,"end":97,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":113,"end":127,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","集魄卫盾"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/jp","魂の盾"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时获得护盾，并为友军提供攻击速度。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/jp","戦闘開始時にシールドを獲得し、味方の攻撃速度をUPさせる"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，瓦丽卡1格范围内每有1名友军，自身获得可抵御24% HP伤害的护盾，护盾值上限为72% HP。同时瓦丽卡为这些友军提升50 + 5点攻击速度，直至战斗结束。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","戦闘開始時、自身の周囲1マス範囲内にいる味方1体につき、24% HPのシールドを獲得。獲得できるシールド値は最大72% HPまで。また、範囲内の味方は永続的に攻撃速度+50 + 5"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":67,"end":71,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":86,"end":90,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":28,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":46,"end":52,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":28,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":56,"end":62,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每有1名友军自身获得的护盾提升至26% HP，护盾值上限提升至78% HP。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","範囲内にいる味方1体につき、獲得するシールド値が26% HPにUP。最大で78% HPまで"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":31,"end":37,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":24,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":37,"end":43,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每有1名友军自身获得的护盾提升至28% HP，护盾值上限提升至84% HP。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","範囲内にいる味方1体につき、獲得するシールド値が28% HPにUP。最大で84% HPまで"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":31,"end":37,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":24,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":37,"end":43,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","每有1名友军自身获得的护盾提升至30% HP，护盾值上限提升至90% HP。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","範囲内にいる味方1体につき、獲得するシールド値が30% HPにUP。最大で90% HPまで"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":31,"end":37,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":24,"end":30,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":37,"end":43,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/name_i18n/jp","天賦の才"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身攻击速度。"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/jp","自身の攻撃速度UP"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击速度提升18点。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の攻撃速度+18"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击速度提升24点。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の攻撃速度+24"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击速度提升30点。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","戦闘中、自身の攻撃速度+30"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","震慑反攻"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/jp","威圧反撃"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","格挡敌人的终极技能并发起反击。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/jp","敵の必殺技をブロックし、反撃する"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","受到来自攻击范围内的敌人的终极技能伤害时，瓦丽卡立即进行格挡，免疫此次伤害立即对该敌人使用终极技能“惧怖厉锋”。此次终极技能不会消耗能量和敌人的“战怖”状态，而是恢复250点能量。本技能施法期间时瓦丽卡处于霸体状态，且每10秒对同一名敌人至多触发一次。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","射程距離内にいる敵からの必殺技ダメージを受ける時、直ちにブロックしてそのダメージを無効化し、攻撃者に必殺技「恐慌の刃」を発動。この場合、必殺技発動はSPを消費せず、対象の「パニック」を解除しない。代わりに、自身のSPを250回復。このスキルの発動中、自身はスーパーアーマー状態になる。このスキルは敵1体につき、10秒ごとに1回まで発動可能"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":103,"end":105,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":128,"end":136,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","格挡后终极技能的能量恢复提升至300点。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","ブロック後の必殺技発動によるSP回復量が300にUP"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","释放本技能的10秒内，自身提高80点攻击速度和60点生命汲取。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","必殺技をブロックした時、10秒間、自身の攻撃速度+80、ライフスティール+60"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","格挡后终极技能的能量恢复提升至350点。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","ブロック後の必殺技発動によるSP回復量が350にUP"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/jp","覚醒の力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","“集魄卫盾”的护盾存在时，普通攻击获得能量。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/jp","「魂の盾」のシールド存在期間中、通常攻撃は追加でSPが回復"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","当“集魄卫盾”的护盾存在时，瓦丽卡的普通攻击额外获得50点能量。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","「魂の盾」のシールド存在期間中、ヴェリカの通常攻撃は追加でSPを50回復"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","自身的每点攻速和急速会提升终极技能0.6%的伤害。每次释放终极技能，瓦丽卡获得“集魄卫盾”，抵御值相当于30% HP。"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","自身の攻撃速度と速度の合計値1Ptにつき、必殺技のダメージ+0.6%。必殺技を発動するたびに、30% HP分の「魂の盾」のシールドを獲得"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":52,"end":58,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":47,"end":53,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","泣骸巨剑"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/jp","泣き骸の巨剣"]]}